# NOT read by any image build in this repository.
#
# A .dockerignore is read from the build CONTEXT root, and all three images are
# built from a subdirectory:
#
#   helmCharts.kaniko("backend/Dockerfile",       "backend",  ...)
#   helmCharts.kaniko("frontend/Dockerfile",      "frontend", ...)
#   helmCharts.kaniko("frontend/Dockerfile.docs", "frontend", ...)
#
# so the files that matter are backend/.dockerignore and
# frontend/.dockerignore. Edit those. This one is kept only for a future build
# whose context is the repository root; the Jenkinsfile's own validation-context
# tar carries its own --exclude flags and does not read it either.
**/.git
**/.pnpm-store
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/node_modules
**/test-results
